    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">1,249,487</span></td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">227,492</span></td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">5,606</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Proposal
5</span></span>:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.5in; text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt">The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved, on a
non-binding advisory basis, the compensation that may be paid or become payable to the Company&#8217;s President and Chief Executive Officer
in connection with the Merger and Asset Sale.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; width: 23%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Votes
    For</b></span></td>
    <td style="padding-bottom: 1pt; width: 2%">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; width: 24%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Votes
    Against</b></span></td>
    <td style="padding-bottom: 1pt; width: 2%">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; width: 24%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Abstentions</b></span></td>
    <td style="padding-bottom: 1pt; width: 2%">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-size: 10pt; width: 23%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Broker
    Non-Votes</b></span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">547,136</span></td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">91,412</span></td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">239,916</span></td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">604,121</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></p>

